                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a simulation game. It doesn't hold your hand at all. The game wants you to build a shelf? How about some messed up looking modern art instead? The choice is yours. I had fun messing around in this game, but obviously it's not going to be for everyone. \n\nPros:\n- Do whatever the hell you want. \n- There's a bunch of tools so you can modify the furniture to make it \"better.\"\n- Lovely soundtrack and a very clean visual style.\n\nCons:\n- Very hard to actually build things.\n- Controls may be frustrating, although that's part of the game's charm",
